<!-- PARAMETERS
@@SLOT@@ - Three-digit pool index (001..400). Lua maps slot → GUID; do not put names in XML ids.

Color / fontSize / fontStyle / textColor come from Defaults classes on the panel.
Lua sets labels with U.setAttributes(id, { text = "...", active = true }) — never UI.setValue.
-->

<Button id="debug_light_selection_@@SLOT@@" class="panel_debug_light_selection_button" active="false" onClick="HUD_debugLightButtonClick"></Button>
